# ========================================================
# IMPORTANT: What is NOT ignored
# ========================================================
#
# ✓ .env.example (template - safe, no secrets)
# ✓ requirements.txt (dependencies - safe)
# ✓ config.yaml.example (template - safe)
# ✓ All source code (*.py files)
# ✓ All documentation (*.md files)
# ✓ All specs and design files
#
# ✗ .env, .secrets.enc, *.db files (secrets and data)
# ✗ node_modules, venv, __pycache__ (generated)
# ✗ .vscode with secrets, IDE settings
# ✗ Local build/dist artifacts
